1
00:00:00,190 --> 00:00:02,690
(Raj:)And now you can't stand to see me
with another woman.

2
00:00:02,859 --> 00:00:04,069
(Penny:)Whoa, whoa, whoa!

3
00:00:04,235 --> 00:00:06,115
(Raj:)It's okay,
I can't get mad at your feelings.

4
00:00:06,279 --> 00:00:07,449
(Penny:)I don't have feelings.

5
00:00:07,614 --> 00:00:10,494
(Raj:)Yeah, that's good.
Keep telling yourseIf that.

6
00:00:12,702 --> 00:00:15,332
(Penny:)He is cuter now that I know he's rich.

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,210
(Raj:)I have a surprise for you.
Cover your eyes.

8
00:00:25,715 --> 00:00:27,635
(Raj:)Open them.

9
00:00:36,142 --> 00:00:38,272
(Raj:)It's a real ruby.

10
00:00:38,937 --> 00:00:44,987
(Raj:)It was a little expensive,
but no one can put a price on love.

11
00:00:45,151 --> 00:00:48,241
AIthough the people at Cartier
took a pretty good shot at it.

12
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:57,710
(Raj:)Oh, Mummy, Daddy,
what a nice surprise.

13
00:00:57,872 --> 00:01:02,022
(Dr Koothrappali:)No, it's not a nice surprise,
it's a bad surprise.

